        <h1>The Merge Conflicts</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          We’re studying Computer Science at Paderborn University and thinking out loud about
          software’s next chapter. Our merge strategy is optimism; our backup strategy is version control.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-note"><strong>Current status</strong> <span>building, learning, occasionally rebasing</span></div>
